*{ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>25July2010)}25 July 2010 {ALINK} Starting July 27, 2010, Lojban enthusiasts in the San Francisco area of the USA will meet together at regular intervals each month to communicate in and about Lojban.  {ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>25July2010)}  More... {ALINK} 


*{ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>19July2010)}19 July 2010 {ALINK} A new milestone has been reached with the implementation of Lojban's structure words ('cmavo') on [http://smart.fm/|Smart.fm] adaptive flashcard learning tool.     {ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>19July2010)}  More... {ALINK} 


*{ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>4July2010)}4 July 2010 {ALINK} Lojbanists [mailto:jjllambias@gmail.com|Jorge Llambias] and [mailto:leos.molas@gmail.com|Leo Molas] have proposed complete sets of Lojban words for all countries, languages and currencies, basing them on ISO codes.  {ALINK(pagename=>What's New?,aname=>4July2010)}  More... {ALINK} 


